#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`bmi270` --- BMI270 6-axis IMU"
msgstr ":mod:`bmi270` --- BMI270 6-osna IMU"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:7
msgid ""
"Driver for the Bosch BMI270 low-power 6-axis inertial measurement unit "
"(3-axis accelerometer plus 3-axis gyroscope) over I2C. The driver performs "
"the full BMI270 initialisation sequence on construction --- soft reset, "
"power-save disable, configuration-blob upload and status verification --- "
"before configuring the requested output data rates and full-scale ranges."
msgstr ""
"Upravljački program za Bosch BMI270 6-osnu inercijsku mjernu jedinicu niske "
"potrošnje (3-osni akcelerometar i 3-osni žiroskop) putem I2C. Upravljački "
"program pri stvaranju izvodi potpunu inicijalizacijsku sekvencu BMI270 --- "
"meki reset, onemogućavanje načina uštede energije, učitavanje "
"konfiguracijskog bloba i provjeru statusa --- prije postavljanja traženih "
"brzina izlaznih podataka i punih raspona mjerenja."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:13
msgid ""
"The class can optionally be linked to an external `bmm150.BMM150` "
"magnetometer instance so that callers may treat a BMI270 + BMM150 pair as a "
"single 9-axis device through the :meth:`magnet` method."
msgstr ""
"Klasa se opcionalno može povezati s vanjskom instancom magnetometra "
"`bmm150.BMM150` tako da pozivatelji mogu tretirati par BMI270 + BMM150 kao "
"jedan 9-osni uređaj putem metode :meth:`magnet`\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:19
msgid ""
"SPI mode is not supported by this driver; passing a non-I2C bus raises "
"``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj upravljački program ne podržava SPI način rada; prosljeđivanje "
"sabirnice koja nije I2C izaziva ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:22
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:36
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klase"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:40
msgid ""
"Construct a ``BMI270`` instance and run the full configuration-load "
"initialisation sequence. Raises ``OSError`` if the chip ID does not match or"
" if the load sequence fails."
msgstr ""
"Stvara instancu ``BMI270`` i pokreće potpunu inicijalizacijsku sekvencu s "
"učitavanjem konfiguracije. Izaziva ``OSError`` ako se ID čipa ne podudara "
"ili ako sekvenca učitavanja ne uspije."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:44
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:45
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirana :py:class:`machine.I2C` sabirnica na koju je senzor "
"priključen."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:47
msgid "``cs``"
msgstr "``cs``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:48
msgid ""
"Reserved for SPI mode. Must be left as ``None``; SPI is not currently "
"implemented and supplying a non-I2C bus raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirano za SPI način rada. Mora ostati ``None``\\ ; SPI trenutno nije "
"implementiran, a navođenje sabirnice koja nije I2C izaziva ``ValueError``\\ "
"."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:52
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:53
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x68``; some boards strap the"
" SDO pin high which selects ``0x69``."
msgstr ""
"7-bitna I2C adresa uređaja. Zadana vrijednost je ``0x68``\\ ; neke ploče "
"postavljaju SDO pin na visoku razinu, čime se odabire ``0x69``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:56
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:57
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0.78``, ``1.5``, ``3.1``,"
" ``6.25``, ``12.5``, ``25``, ``50``, ``100``, ``200``, ``400``, ``800`` or "
"``1200``."
msgstr ""
"Brzina izlaznih podataka žiroskopa u Hz. Mora biti jedna od ``0.78``\\ , "
"``1.5``\\ , ``3.1``\\ , ``6.25``\\ , ``12.5``\\ , ``25``\\ , ``50``\\ , "
"``100``\\ , ``200``\\ , ``400``\\ , ``800`` ili ``1200``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:61
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:62
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``125``, "
"``250``, ``500``, ``1000`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Puni raspon mjerenja žiroskopa u stupnjevima u sekundi. Mora biti jedan od "
"``125``\\ , ``250``\\ , ``500``\\ , ``1000`` ili ``2000``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:65
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:66
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Brzina izlaznih podataka akcelerometra u Hz. Isti skup vrijednosti kao "
"``gyro_odr``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:69
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:70
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Puni raspon mjerenja akcelerometra u g. Mora biti jedan od ``2``\\ , ``4``\\"
" , ``8`` ili ``16``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:73
msgid "``bmm_magnet``"
msgstr "``bmm_magnet``"

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:74
msgid ""
"Optional `bmm150.BMM150` instance. When provided, the :meth:`magnet` method "
"delegates to it; otherwise :meth:`magnet` returns zeros."
msgstr ""
"Opcionalna instanca `bmm150.BMM150`\\ . Kada je navedena, metoda "
":meth:`magnet` delegira poziv na nju; u suprotnom :meth:`magnet` vraća nule."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:80
msgid ""
"Issue the BMI270 soft-reset command. After calling this the device must be "
"re-initialised before further use."
msgstr ""
"Izdaje BMI270 naredbu za meki reset. Nakon poziva ove naredbe uređaj se mora"
" ponovno inicijalizirati prije daljnje upotrebe."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:85
msgid ""
"Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second, scaled "
"according to ``gyro_scale``."
msgstr ""
"Vraća vektor žiroskopa ``(x, y, z)`` u stupnjevima u sekundi, skaliran prema"
" ``gyro_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:90
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²), scaled according to ``accel_scale``."
msgstr ""
"Vraća vektor ubrzanja ``(x, y, z)`` u jedinicama standardne gravitacije (1 g"
" = 9.81 m/s²), skaliran prema ``accel_scale``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmi270.rst:95
msgid ""
"If a ``bmm_magnet`` was supplied at construction, return the latest "
"magnetometer reading from that device. Otherwise return ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)``."
msgstr ""
"Ako je pri stvaranju naveden ``bmm_magnet``\\ , vraća najnovije očitanje "
"magnetometra s tog uređaja. U suprotnom vraća ``(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)``\\ ."
